abstract: |-
  The aim of this learning module is to provide an introduction to Snakemake for particle physics data analysis.

  After completing this module, participants will be able to:
  - Create and run Snakemake workflows using rules.
  - Use wildcards to process multiple files in parallel.
  - Implement checkpoints for dynamic file discovery.
  - Build reproducible workflows using containers and Apptainer.
  - Configure and run workflows on HTCondor using workflow profiles.
  - Visualise and validate workflow execution using DAGs and dry-runs.
keywords:
